","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T15:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389369","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4915250-1840944183773489","game_id":"steam-4915250","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — New Taunts, QoL & Smarter AI","summary":"Demo UpdateThanks to everyone who tried the demo and sent feedback — here's a big polish pass. New Four new taunts (ten in total) to tease your rivals Free-look camera — press V to look around with the mouse and move with the arrow keys (no more holding right-click) Wall preview — a ghost wall shows exactly where your wall will land A first-time prompt now invites new players to the tutorial Improved The camera follows the AI on its turn, just like it does yours The AI now reliably springs a tra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T09:35:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4915250-1839676055884496","game_id":"steam-4915250","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hatch'n'Wall Demo is Now Available!","summary":"After countless hours of work, I'm incredibly excited to finally share the very first public demo of Hatch'n'Wall!What started as a handmade board game created by my father-in-law for his children over 20 years ago has slowly evolved into the digital strategy game you can play today. It's been an amazing journey, and this demo marks an important milestone. What can you expect?Take a look of what the Hatch'n'Wall demo includes:While the demo already represents the core experience, I'm still activ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T07:47:01Z","time_precision":"